WEBVTT

00:37.127 --> 00:39.379
<i>About 60% bloomed…</i>

00:53.769 --> 00:58.106
FOOL NIGHT

02:12.639 --> 02:14.474
I see you bought new ones.

02:15.684 --> 02:17.102
When's payday?

02:17.978 --> 02:21.273
Here's your ID and employee handbook.

02:21.356 --> 02:25.110
You'll be a Special Temporary Worker
in the Spiriflor Locator Division.

02:26.695 --> 02:31.032
Chipping away at Transflora Medical's
Missing Spiriflor Reports is your job.

02:31.616 --> 02:35.579
We're drowning in these requests
that pour in while we're out searching.

02:36.329 --> 02:39.166
I'm fine with anything
if I'm getting paid over 150,000.

02:39.249 --> 02:41.543
Okay, I'm off to the reception desk.

02:41.626 --> 02:43.545
You're the receptionist, Yomiko?

02:43.628 --> 02:45.922
I do everything around here.

02:46.006 --> 02:47.841
Hence, my "Unsection" position.

02:50.051 --> 02:50.886
Hello?

02:50.969 --> 02:54.014
Yeah, okay. Sure, I'll go right now.

02:55.724 --> 02:57.475
You've just got your first client!

03:07.235 --> 03:08.528
Heart rate skyrocketing.

03:08.612 --> 03:10.739
The cut is too big to stop the bleeding.

03:12.616 --> 03:15.201
At this rate,
he'll die before reaching the hospital.

03:15.869 --> 03:17.370
Don't you dare let him die.

03:18.830 --> 03:22.375
If a doctor can't save him,
head to Transflora Medical instead.

03:23.209 --> 03:24.628
Officer…

03:32.344 --> 03:33.178
INTAKE FORM

03:33.261 --> 03:35.639
What? Sumi Matsuno?

03:35.722 --> 03:36.556
That's you?

03:36.640 --> 03:37.515
Who?

03:37.599 --> 03:39.559
Haven't you seen her posters?

03:39.643 --> 03:42.520
It's the pianist, Sumi Matsuno!
Isn't that cool?

03:42.604 --> 03:44.189
"Pianist"? As if.

03:44.898 --> 03:47.067
I'm still a student with mediocre skills.

03:48.485 --> 03:50.487
I bet you go to some fancy music schoo--

03:51.279 --> 03:53.198
Sorry, this guy's new.

03:53.281 --> 03:54.908
So, what brings you here?

03:56.117 --> 03:58.578
I want you to find my father's Spiriflor.

04:00.288 --> 04:02.958
My family wasn't wealthy in the slightest.

04:03.792 --> 04:07.879
My father underwent transfloration
and spent the subsidy on my education.

04:07.963 --> 04:11.341
Yet he hasn't come back
since the day of his procedure.

04:11.967 --> 04:14.719
My father is the reason I'm where I am.

04:14.803 --> 04:16.513
I want to properly mourn his loss.

04:18.848 --> 04:22.060
Please tell us your father's name
and approximate age.

04:22.143 --> 04:23.019
TRANSFLORATION REPORT

04:23.103 --> 04:24.187
Shogo Matsuno.

04:24.271 --> 04:26.815
A piano teacher
from National Music College No. 2.

04:27.482 --> 04:31.695
According to these records,
his motive for transfloration was…

04:31.778 --> 04:33.071
MERCURY POISONING

04:35.198 --> 04:36.574
…probably suicide.

04:38.410 --> 04:42.664
As you stated, he likely underwent
transfloration just to receive a subsidy.

04:43.832 --> 04:47.711
After all, we can't refuse
dying patients requesting transfloration…

04:48.378 --> 04:51.840
Many patients leave their families
following the procedure.

04:52.549 --> 04:56.636
Seeking a final resting place,
they usually end up at their workplace.

04:57.345 --> 05:00.515
The seed planted into Shogo
was a Sawafutagi.

05:01.516 --> 05:05.729
The procedure was three years ago,
so he should be a full-on Spiriflor now.

05:05.812 --> 05:08.982
I suppose we'll start
by searching the college campus.

05:09.065 --> 05:11.109
Are Sawafutagi trees rare?

05:11.192 --> 05:12.110
No.

05:12.193 --> 05:15.739
If he's a Spiriflor,
how can you tell which one is my father?

05:15.822 --> 05:18.116
It's usually quite difficult. However,

05:19.034 --> 05:21.745
this man can talk to Spiriflora directly.

05:27.334 --> 05:28.793
That's all for today.

05:29.502 --> 05:31.504
I'll contact you if we find anything.

05:32.547 --> 05:33.715
Okay.

05:35.091 --> 05:37.052
Sorry, I'll need to get going.

05:38.970 --> 05:41.890
Hello? Yes… Huh?

05:44.100 --> 05:45.977
You're not going back?

05:46.478 --> 05:48.188
You're shooting daggers at me.

05:48.271 --> 05:49.814
Because you're judging me.

05:49.898 --> 05:51.608
I'm desperate, you know.

05:51.691 --> 05:53.902
What do you mean,
you can talk to Spiriflora?

05:54.527 --> 05:57.280
You say you're desperate,
yet it's taken you three years.

05:57.822 --> 05:59.199
Well, that's because…

06:00.033 --> 06:02.368
You hate your father.

06:04.746 --> 06:07.082
When you talked about him back there,

06:07.665 --> 06:10.877
the Spiriflor next to you
sensed your hatred.

06:12.045 --> 06:13.880
What are you trying to do?

06:13.963 --> 06:16.841
Why do you wanna find
your father's Spiriflor?

06:18.259 --> 06:21.346
If you pay me, I'll help you destroy it…

06:24.099 --> 06:25.350
I want to burn it.

06:27.894 --> 06:30.688
I want to burn down my father's Spiriflor.

06:47.122 --> 06:48.915
Not so fast, Officer!

06:48.998 --> 06:51.709
For transfloration,
we need his permission first!

06:51.793 --> 06:55.213
He's on death's door. Haven't you heard?
The transfloration murders.

06:55.296 --> 06:57.340
He's the only survivor.

06:58.133 --> 07:00.677
Planting a seed
can save even a dying human, right?

07:00.760 --> 07:03.513
There's a chance
he saw the serial killer's face!

07:04.013 --> 07:05.140
You only care about invest--

07:05.223 --> 07:07.183
Twenty people have been killed already.

07:08.143 --> 07:10.979
No matter what,
we have to stop these casualties.

07:11.062 --> 07:13.898
Now's not the time
to fuss over rules and permits!

07:14.482 --> 07:17.152
Keep him alive!
Do the transfloration right now!

07:20.405 --> 07:22.782
Inose, get a special
transfloration permit, now!

07:23.741 --> 07:24.909
Yes, ma'am!

07:42.510 --> 07:44.262
Is playing the piano fun?

07:44.345 --> 07:45.180
Not at all.

07:46.973 --> 07:49.934
I hate it. I was just forced into it.

07:54.731 --> 07:57.609
My father was adamant
when it came to that piano.

07:57.692 --> 08:00.987
One mistake, and he'd beat me
with a terrifying look on his face

08:01.070 --> 08:03.072
until I could play it perfectly.

08:03.990 --> 08:06.159
That's why you wanna burn him down?

08:06.242 --> 08:07.285
Yeah.

08:07.785 --> 08:10.413
He still haunts me
whenever I play the piano.

08:10.497 --> 08:12.207
Even though he's dead.

08:13.416 --> 08:15.251
Do you have any hobbies?

08:18.171 --> 08:19.589
Money?

08:20.840 --> 08:22.800
Yeah, I guess that's important.

08:29.224 --> 08:30.934
How did this happen?

08:31.643 --> 08:33.353
In the case of a nearly-dead body,

08:33.436 --> 08:37.190
the implanted seed
will accelerate its growth to avoid death.

08:37.273 --> 08:39.192
It happens sometimes, apparently.

08:39.275 --> 08:43.863
Couldn't you have saved his mouth somehow?
At least he'd still be able to talk…

08:43.947 --> 08:46.032
You made me do it…

08:46.115 --> 08:48.743
Mr. Hiyama's parents have arrived.

09:10.557 --> 09:12.475
PATH TO SPIRIFLORA FOREST

09:31.244 --> 09:34.497
Crazy to have a forest like this
hidden behind a college.

09:34.581 --> 09:36.416
How far does it go?

09:36.499 --> 09:40.211
I think it covers an area
the size of a small mountain.

09:42.505 --> 09:45.258
<i>Nah, we're never gonna find it.</i>

09:51.014 --> 09:52.265
This way.

09:54.851 --> 09:56.060
Here it is.

09:56.644 --> 09:59.606
Yup, no doubt about it.
Hurry, before someone comes--

09:59.689 --> 10:00.523
Liar.

10:01.858 --> 10:03.568
Hey, wait up.

10:03.651 --> 10:06.696
That Spiriflor
doesn't even look like a Sawafutagi.

10:06.779 --> 10:10.116
It's totally different
from the photo that woman showed us.

10:11.034 --> 10:12.076
Hold on!

10:12.827 --> 10:13.661
Hold on.

10:14.162 --> 10:15.330
Sorry, okay?

10:18.041 --> 10:19.834
I'll do it for real this time.

10:20.501 --> 10:21.919
What do you mean, "This time"?

10:22.003 --> 10:23.338
What do you mean, "For real"?

10:24.255 --> 10:27.717
I'll stop at nothing
to burn down my father's Spiriflor.

10:29.218 --> 10:30.219
Out of fear?

10:32.347 --> 10:36.309
If you hate playing,
why don't you quit being a pianist?

10:37.769 --> 10:40.313
If I could, I'd love to quit.

10:40.396 --> 10:43.816
Put yourself in my shoes for a second.

10:44.484 --> 10:48.571
My father sacrificed his own life
so I could afford my college tuition.

10:49.447 --> 10:51.240
After he went and did that,

10:51.324 --> 10:54.118
I had no choice but to become a pianist!

10:56.204 --> 10:59.749
How else do you expect
a woman to survive alone in this world?

10:59.832 --> 11:01.167
What happens after I quit?

11:01.250 --> 11:04.379
Sex work? A factory job? Customer service?

11:04.462 --> 11:07.423
Those are the ones
getting left behind to die on the street.

11:07.507 --> 11:09.759
Piano is all I have.

11:09.842 --> 11:11.469
It's all I know!

11:11.552 --> 11:13.429
I wasn't allowed to do anything else!

11:15.223 --> 11:16.557
And that's why

11:17.350 --> 11:19.936
I want to free myself from my father,
once and for all.

11:20.019 --> 11:24.357
Instead of playing against my will,
I want to play on my own terms.

11:33.699 --> 11:36.411
I don't know how to locate Spiriflora.

11:38.037 --> 11:41.707
All I can do is hear their voices.

11:41.791 --> 11:45.503
I can confirm the Spiriflor's identity,
but only after finding it.

11:46.462 --> 11:47.880
That's not very helpful.

11:49.006 --> 11:51.342
So, let's ask a pro to help us locate it.

12:00.643 --> 12:02.103
Please leave us alone.

12:02.687 --> 12:03.896
Even his face.

12:05.189 --> 12:06.524
Everything.

12:06.607 --> 12:08.734
I couldn't even hold his hand…

12:20.037 --> 12:23.082
Okay, got it. Thanks, Yomiko.

12:23.708 --> 12:26.586
He was a pianist,
so the transfloration likely solidified

12:26.669 --> 12:28.796
within audible range of a piano.

12:28.880 --> 12:31.799
Also, a Sawafutagi
will look like fireworks

12:31.883 --> 12:33.843
when viewed from a distance.

12:35.470 --> 12:37.054
Wait, maybe it was a sparkler…

12:38.764 --> 12:40.433
Sounds like someone's practicing.

12:40.516 --> 12:41.559
Let's go.

12:56.491 --> 12:59.452
They only fawn over you
because you're young.

12:59.535 --> 13:01.579
Your need to find your own style.

13:03.289 --> 13:04.957
Are you really Matsuno's daughter?

13:06.292 --> 13:07.543
Boring.

13:15.176 --> 13:16.552
I hear it.

13:16.636 --> 13:19.639
"So… hopeless…"

13:19.722 --> 13:23.976
"How did… get into… this school…"

13:24.060 --> 13:25.561
"Just… terrible…"

13:28.564 --> 13:29.690
Found him.

13:34.695 --> 13:36.113
Sawafutagi…

13:40.743 --> 13:43.913
All the branches are facing the school.

13:46.707 --> 13:48.084
Dad…

13:48.834 --> 13:51.879
It's been grumbling
ever since that piano started playing.

13:53.756 --> 13:55.299
He hasn't changed at all.

14:09.230 --> 14:10.439
You're hesitating.

14:10.523 --> 14:11.774
No, I'm not.

14:12.275 --> 14:16.445
The tree is sensing
your feelings of hesitation and agony.

14:17.029 --> 14:19.991
If you're gonna regret it,
stop while you're ahead.

14:20.074 --> 14:21.075
It's not that.

14:21.951 --> 14:25.079
My gratitude to him for raising me
is just getting in the way.

14:41.596 --> 14:44.140
Starting tomorrow,
you'd better practice hard.

14:44.974 --> 14:45.850
Okay.

14:49.812 --> 14:54.191
Are you a good father, or a bad father?
Make up your mind!

14:55.151 --> 14:59.113
Regardless, that violence
is the one thing I'll never forgive.

15:00.197 --> 15:02.241
You're definitely in the wrong.

15:07.997 --> 15:09.123
Translate.

15:09.707 --> 15:11.375
Wait, I can only listen…

15:11.459 --> 15:13.127
Tell him, right now.

15:13.210 --> 15:15.880
I can't let this end as a one-sided feud!

15:17.089 --> 15:18.174
But I…

15:21.218 --> 15:22.345
I told you, I can't.

15:23.095 --> 15:24.096
Please.

15:29.518 --> 15:30.561
Why?

15:31.604 --> 15:32.563
Why?

15:53.084 --> 15:54.627
What's happening?

15:59.548 --> 16:00.675
Tell him.

16:01.676 --> 16:02.802
Tell my dad.

16:02.885 --> 16:04.470
That I'll never forgive him!

16:05.012 --> 16:05.846
Tell him?

16:06.389 --> 16:07.348
Please.

16:11.477 --> 16:15.481
Your daughter says
she'll never forgive you.

16:15.564 --> 16:19.527
She didn't want to play the piano,
but you were abusive and forced her.

16:19.610 --> 16:21.946
It's your fault that she hates the piano.

16:30.162 --> 16:31.497
<i>Sumi?</i>

16:32.665 --> 16:33.624
"Sumi?

16:36.711 --> 16:38.713
That hatred I sensed just now.

16:39.422 --> 16:41.215
It was you, Sumi?

16:41.841 --> 16:45.177
Why are you holding a grudge against me?

16:45.261 --> 16:46.887
You don't like the piano?

16:46.971 --> 16:48.931
Did you quit playing?"

16:49.015 --> 16:51.058
No, I haven't quit.

16:51.976 --> 16:54.437
But I've been suffering all this time!

16:55.354 --> 16:56.522
She hasn't quit.

16:57.106 --> 16:59.859
But your barbaric teaching methods
traumatized her.

17:00.443 --> 17:02.194
She's suffered all this time.

17:06.824 --> 17:07.867
"Suffered?

17:08.701 --> 17:10.119
That's only natural.

17:10.703 --> 17:13.122
Life is unfair,
and everyone has to endure it.

17:14.498 --> 17:18.210
For once, try thinking about
how privileged you are."

17:18.919 --> 17:20.963
<i>I'm the reason you're alive.</i>

17:21.756 --> 17:24.842
<i>I taught you the piano</i>
<i>and gave you my transfloration subsidy.</i>

17:28.345 --> 17:31.515
How's she supposed to respond to that?

17:31.599 --> 17:33.059
What a coward.

17:40.149 --> 17:41.859
<i>That's like a mother telling her kid</i>

17:41.942 --> 17:45.404
that they're only alive
because she gave birth to 'em.

17:47.531 --> 17:48.991
Apologize to her!

17:49.075 --> 17:53.079
Have you ever thought about
the terror she endured because of you?

17:59.418 --> 18:02.671
<i>I feel a piece of Sumi flowing toward me…</i>

18:04.465 --> 18:05.925
You're sick of playing?

18:09.053 --> 18:10.554
The piano is your only option.

18:10.638 --> 18:13.516
Mark my words, you'll thank me one day.

18:13.599 --> 18:15.518
The day will come when you'll realize that

18:15.601 --> 18:18.229
all this practice
is what helped you find happiness!

18:18.771 --> 18:20.189
It's all for your sake.

18:20.272 --> 18:21.607
<i>Are you listening to me?</i>

18:25.277 --> 18:26.403
Get up, now.

18:28.364 --> 18:29.240
Keep playing!

18:30.157 --> 18:30.991
Stop…

18:33.494 --> 18:34.829
Don't do that…

18:37.164 --> 18:40.209
Starting tomorrow,
you'd better practice hard.

18:40.292 --> 18:41.127
Okay.

18:42.086 --> 18:44.380
Thanks, Dad.

18:47.299 --> 18:48.843
Why don't you understand?

18:51.804 --> 18:53.222
<i>How come I never noticed?</i>

18:54.723 --> 18:57.184
<i>How could I ignore this suffering?</i>

18:58.686 --> 19:00.354
<i>It should've been obvious</i>

19:00.437 --> 19:02.898
<i>if I had just listened to her.</i>

19:02.982 --> 19:04.358
Stop!

19:05.651 --> 19:06.527
<i>Why?</i>

19:10.072 --> 19:13.826
<i>Why couldn't I realize this</i>
<i>while I was still human?</i>

19:20.583 --> 19:24.545
<i>I was… wrong…</i>

19:33.095 --> 19:35.181
There's no way I'll forgive you.

19:50.529 --> 19:51.530
Dad…

19:53.699 --> 19:55.576
I'll make a piano out of you.

20:37.117 --> 20:40.663
<i>From now on, you won't leave my sight.</i>

20:40.746 --> 20:42.623
<i>You'll be within my grasp.</i>

20:46.585 --> 20:48.254
<i>Serves you right.</i>

20:48.337 --> 20:51.257
<i>This is payback.</i>
<i>Let's see how you like it!</i>

20:56.971 --> 20:58.138
<i>Sorry.</i>

21:25.541 --> 21:28.168
<i>Now it's my turn to be free.</i>

21:32.047 --> 21:33.674
That was fun, wasn't it?

21:33.757 --> 21:35.718
Yeah, let's go again sometime.

21:35.801 --> 21:37.636
Homework comes first, okay?

21:44.685 --> 21:47.855
<i>I might actually get killed this time.</i>

21:47.938 --> 21:50.774
<i>But I have money and status now.</i>

22:15.466 --> 22:16.675
Mom…

22:36.862 --> 22:38.697
Just die.

22:38.781 --> 22:40.491
Just die!

22:40.574 --> 22:42.326
Please, just die already!

23:32.042 --> 23:36.171
Your son may have been involved
in a series of transfloration crimes

23:36.255 --> 23:39.216
committed by a human
whose procedure activated their powers.

23:39.800 --> 23:42.302
The transfloration policy
is nothing but a tragedy.

23:42.386 --> 23:44.680
Who are you, exactly?

23:44.763 --> 23:46.515
I'm here to recruit you.

23:46.598 --> 23:50.727
Please lend your support
to our anti-transfloration movement.

25:16.438 --> 25:20.442
Subtitle translation by: Logan Lampkins
